Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 16:59:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Aegis: hide sensitive CDP targets and show live agent
 connections

Remote CDP lists only the browser target and http(s) pages. Loopback
agent WebSocket counts appear on chrome://aegis.
